  "notes": [
    "Common foods were tested with current HP 1 and maximum HP 100 to avoid healing caps.",
    "For item 0x08, a selected food item with no fish stored in the basket did not change HP or consume a fish. With a fish record present, the game consumed that fish and the observed healing matched floor(raw_size/4) for all tested sizes 4 through 200.",
    "The size/HP values above remain controlled runtime observations: species IDs 0x01, 0x06, 0x08, 0x20, 0x38, and 0x49 all yielded the same +7 at raw size 30, and one species was sampled at sizes 4 through 200. The later ROM trace establishes the ordinary-fish arithmetic separately; no claim is made for malformed memory records.",
    "Item 0x09 and 0x0A both displayed きのこ in the tested menu; 0x09 restored 10 HP and 0x0A set HP to zero."
  ]
